// 004.12, 014.1 (#19): `Default` / `Exception` rules with `Yields` on a `Function` or `Var`
// may read declared `Param`s and free holding facts without triggering `CHR102`.
Fact k Identified by A, B.
Param base = 5.
Fact override-rate Identified by k * int.

Function fee Identified by k * int
  Default base-fee Yields base When True
  Exception custom-fee Overrides base-fee Yields override-rate.int When override-rate.k == k.

Var cap : Int
  Default base-cap Yields base * 2 When True.

+override-rate(B, 12).
?fee(A, 5).
?fee(B, 12).
?cap(10).
